HA-Theme-gov.uk licence notice
==============================

This repository combines original code with design values derived from the
GOV.UK Design System. Two licences apply.

1. Original code in this repository (theme YAML, card snippets, scripts,
   documentation) is released under the MIT Licence below.

2. Colour values, spacing and typographic conventions derived from GOV.UK
   Frontend (https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-frontend) are Crown copyright,
   made available under the Open Government Licence v3.0:
   https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/

Not included and not licensed here: the GDS Transport typeface and the GOV.UK
crown logo and brand marks. GDS Transport is licensed for use on GOV.UK
services only; this theme falls back to Arial. This project is unofficial and
is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Government Digital Service or Home
Assistant.

